; Caulder, D1 "Claw, low": the sketch D hook an octave down. Low strings carry it, the horn stabs sit an octave lower, the gallop and kit are unchanged. B minor, 124 bpm. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
song caulder_d1
tempo 124
meter 4/4
reverb 173
priority 0

